lodepng
------------------------------------------
PNG image decoder and encoder

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblodepng-devel-0+git20261102-1bl1
  liblodepng0-0+git20261102-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libSDL2-devel-2.32.74-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/lvandeve/lodepng

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/lvandeve/lodepng.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack lodepng-0+git20261102-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./lodepng-0+git20261102-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/lodepng-0+git20261102-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lodepng-0+git20261102-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblodepng0-0+git20261102-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblodepng-devel-0+git20261102-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(lodepng)
  /usr/bin/pngdetail.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/lodepng.README
  /usr/share/doc/lodepng/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/lodepng/README.md

(liblodepng0)
  /usr/bin/cyglodepng-0.dll

(liblodepng-devel)
  /usr/include/lodepng.h
  /usr/lib/liblodepng.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/lodepng.pc

